# Accounting ERP feed: GET /api/erp/upload-log (Authorization: Bearer <ERP_API_KEY>).
# Rotate: generate a new random key (for example `openssl rand -hex 32`), set ERP_API_KEY in Vercel,
# redeploy, then give the ERP the new key. Unset = the endpoint answers 401 to everyone. Never commit the real value.
ERP_API_KEY=

# Calculator > Price Research: scrape competitor prices on demand through Apify (Super Admin / Admin press "Scrape").
# APIFY_TOKEN: Apify console > Settings > API & Integrations. Without it the Scrape button says it is not set up.
# No marketplace login or cookie is needed (Shopee: lergassy/shopee-scraper, tested).
# APIFY_ACTOR_SHOPEE / APIFY_ACTOR_TOKOPEDIA / APIFY_ACTOR_TIKTOK: optional, replace the default actor (see src/lib/priceResearch.ts).
APIFY_TOKEN=
